# OpenCode 2.3.0: a slow turn (the mock streams "slow please" for about
# 40 s), stopped with Esc. This build ignores the first Esc and aborts on
# the second; the records say state=clear then state=idle.
wait-for 60000 Ask anything
wait 2000
text slow please
wait 300
key enter
wait-for 60000 esc interrupt
wait 1000
key esc
wait 1000
key esc
wait 6000
